<title>USA: Elbit Ltd Q1 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Elbit Ltd Q1 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(U.S. $ in millions, except per share information)</p>
<p>					     For the three</p>
<p>						 month ending</p>
<p>						   March 31,</p>
<p>						 1997     1996</p>
<p>    Net Revenues			    9.3	7.1</p>
<p>    Gross Profit (Loss)		   3.4	2.7</p>
<p>Operating Loss from</p>
<p>	Continuing Operations	   (1.8)    (1.3)</p>
<p>    Total Operating Loss		(1.8)    (1.6)</p>
<p>    Other Income (Expenses), net	1.2	1.1</p>
<p>Profit (Loss) Before</p>
<p>     Provision for Taxes		(1.2)    (1.9)</p>
<p>    Net Profit (Loss)		   (1.4)    (1.8)</p>
<p>    Profit (Loss) Per Share	 ( 0.07)  ( 0.09)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1997 results reflect higher revenues and worldwide acceptance of its &quot;I-TEX Inspected&quot; label, an automatic inspection and quality monitoring system, in the textile industry.</p>
</text>
